Input: {"decision_time_ms": 1790204399999, "macro_contexts": {"D1": {"context": {"always_in": "long", "always_in_relevance": "medium", "breakout_mode": true, "confidence": "medium", "decision_time_ms": 1790121599999, "directional_pressure": "bull", "evidence_against": ["Most of the recent window is range, not trend: bars 51-84 (34 bars) and 88-107 (20 bars) are overlapping two-sided structures, so 54 of the last 69 bars are range bars even though the swing sequence is bullish.", "Price is at the extreme top of the window and bar 119 (high 2776.18, close 2752.43) fails to exceed bar 118's 2850 and closes below its open, a pause bar immediately after a spike bar.", "Upper tails appear on the largest bars: bar 118 closes 74.39 below its 2850 high on a 208-point range (about 36 percent of the bar) and bar 85 closes 41.64 below its 2293.80 high, showing selling into strength at the highs.", "The advance from 1916.51 (bar 85) to 2850 (+49 percent) in 34 bars has had no sustained multi-bar retracement after bar 87, a profile at least as compatible with spike/climax behaviour as with a mature channel; in this method a spike leg alone does not establish that the next leg continues."], "evidence_for": ["Swing progression since bar 31 is a clean sequence of higher highs and higher lows: 1944.39 (bar 50) to 2771 (bar 87) to 2850 (bar 118), with rising lows at 1512.91 (bar 31), 1803.74 (bar 52), 2357.18 (bar 99) and 2358.62 (bar 112).", "Two large bull bars produced accepted breakouts: bar 85 (range 388, close 2252.16) ended the 34-bar 1803.74-1974.46 range and price never closed back below 2111 (bar 86 low); bar 118 then closed 2775.61 near the window high after taking out 2771.", "Pullbacks inside the post-bar-85 advance are shallow relative to the legs (2557.46 to 2357.18 is about 8 percent), and the 20-bar consolidation at bars 88-107 held well above the prior breakout, the behaviour of a trending market rather than a two-sided range.", "Nine of the last twelve bars (108, 109, 111, 113, 114, 115, 116, 117, 118) closed above their opens, and the last five closes are all above 2397, so the most recent leg has directional follow-through."], "missing_information": [], "observations": ["120 closed D1 bars, first open_time 1779753600000 (open 2109.85) to last open_time 1790035200000 (close 2752.43); window high 2850 at bar 118, window low 1368.42 at bar 11.", "Bars 0-11 fall from high 2138.82 (bar 0) to low 1368.42 (bar 11); bar 11 (open 1581.32) closes 1568.55, leaving a ~200-point lower tail, and bar 12 immediately reverses to close 1687.83.", "Bars 12-36 are two-sided and heavily overlapping between low 1512.91 (bar 31) and high 1845.09 (bar 20); bars 22-36 form a narrower lower band with three tests of 1551.60-1560.05.", "Bars 37-50 close progressively higher; bar 49 (open 1775.60) closes 1889.93 and bar 50 prints high 1944.39.", "Bars 51-84 rotate in a 34-bar range between 1803.74 (bar 52 low) and 1974.46 (bar 62 high); bars 74-84 tighten to roughly 1868-1919 on small-range bars.", "Bar 85 (open 1916.51) closes 2252.16 at high 2293.80 with a 388-point range, breaking out of that 34-bar range; bars 86-87 extend the leg to 2771.", "Bars 88-107 hold above the breakout in a 20-bar range between 2357.18 (bar 99 low) and 2557.46 (bar 93 high).", "Bar 108 (open 2437) closes 2514.72 at high 2680; bars 110-114 pull back to 2358.62 (bar 112 closes 2397.10).", "Bars 115-118 close 2612.02, 2632.98, 2642.90 and 2775.61, taking out 2771 to a new window high 2850; bar 119 (open 2775.60, high 2776.18, low 2716.01, close 2752.43) is a small bear bar that fails to exceed bar 118's high."], "phase": "breakout-spike", "primary_regime": "bull-trend", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Bear swing, bars 0-11: eleven lower closes from 2072.79 to 1568.55; 12 bars carry price from the 2138.82 window high down to 1368.42, and bar 11's long lower tail with a close back at 1568.55 marks climactic rejection of that low rather than a clean close at the extreme.", "end_time_ms": 1780790399999, "kind": "swing", "lower_boundary": "1368.42", "start_time_ms": 1779753600000, "upper_boundary": "2138.82"}, {"description": "Post-selloff trading range, bars 12-36: two-sided, overlapping bars between 1512.91 (bar 31 low) and 1845.09 (bar 20 high); the second half (bars 22-36) sits in a lower band near 1551-1740 with three separate low tests around 1551.60-1560.05.", "end_time_ms": 1782950399999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "1512.91", "start_time_ms": 1780790400000, "upper_boundary": "1845.09"}, {"description": "Bull leg, bars 37-50: higher closes from bar 37's 1597.72 low to bar 50's 1944.39 high, including a large bull bar at 49 (open 1775.60, close 1889.93) and a 1804.49-1828.20 high zone at bars 40-41. This leg lifts price out of the 1512.91-1845.09 base.", "end_time_ms": 1784073599999, "kind": "swing", "lower_boundary": "1597.72", "start_time_ms": 1782950400000, "upper_boundary": "1944.39"}, {"description": "Large trading range, bars 51-84: 34 bars rotating between 1803.74 (bar 52 low) and 1974.46 (bar 62 high), with 1954-1959 highs at bars 57 and 61; bars 74-84 compress into a tight ~1868-1919 zone on small bodies before the breakout.", "end_time_ms": 1787097599999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "1803.74", "start_time_ms": 1784073600000, "upper_boundary": "1974.46"}, {"description": "Bull spike, bars 85-87: bar 85 breaks the 34-bar range with a 388-point bar (open 1916.51, high 2293.80, close 2252.16), and bars 86-87 continue to 2771, an ~850-point advance in three bars.", "end_time_ms": 1787356799999, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "1905.63", "start_time_ms": 1787097600000, "upper_boundary": "2771"}, {"description": "Bull-flag range, bars 88-107: 20 overlapping bars between 2357.18 (bar 99 low) and 2557.46 (bar 93 high), all holding far above the bar-85 breakout low; bar 112 later dips back to 2358.62 inside this general zone.", "end_time_ms": 1788998399999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2357.18", "start_time_ms": 1787356800000, "upper_boundary": "2557.46"}, {"description": "Second bull breakout, bars 108-119: bar 108 (open 2437) closes 2514.72 at high 2680, a five-bar pullback reaches 2358.62 (bar 112), then bars 115-118 run to a new window high 2850 (bar 118, close 2775.61) before bar 119 stalls with a 2776.18 high.", "end_time_ms": 1790035199999, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "2358.62", "start_time_ms": 1789084800000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "D1", "transition_conditions": ["Bull continuation: a daily close above 2850 (bar 118 high) with the close in the upper half of the bar and no close below 2716.01 (bar 119 low) keeps the breakout-spike read and extends the higher-high sequence.", "Shift to range: several consecutive closes back inside 2357.18-2557.46 (the bar 88-107 band) without a new high would make the post-bar-85 structure a trading range and move phase toward 'range'.", "Trend-doubt: a close below 2436.87 (bar 115 low) or 2435.72 (bar 108 low) would break the higher low that the latest leg tested and push primary_regime toward transition-unclear.", "Larger reversal evidence: a close below 2358.62 (bar 112 low) followed by a lower swing high would break the last higher low of the bull sequence and make a retracement toward 2111 (bar 86 low) the dominant structural read.", "Acceleration or exhaustion: another bull bar with a range above 250 closing at a new high confirms the spike phase, while a bear reversal bar closing below 2716.01 after a new high would raise the mtr-like top alternative to the current read."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "current"}, "H4": {"context": {"always_in": "long", "always_in_relevance": "low", "breakout_mode": true, "confidence": "medium", "decision_time_ms": 1790193599999, "directional_pressure": "bear", "evidence_against": ["The 2850 spike was fully retraced within 14 bars (pullback low 2641.37 is below the spike's 2658.81 open) and 2850 was never retested, which weakens the breakout.", "2804.59 (bar 1790020800000) is a lower high after 2850, and the last two bars closed below the 2716.01-2804.59 range, so the immediate structure is two-sided to lower.", "Thirteen overlapping bars between 2716.01 and 2804.59 is range behavior, not a rising channel, and upper tails on 1789977600000 (2850 vs 2723.15 close) and 1789992000000 (2795 vs 2754.31 close) show selling at highs.", "Roughly 70 of 120 bars (2411.04-2545.29, plus spikes) are a broad trading range, so the trend leg is a trend inside a larger range, not an established multi-leg trend."], "evidence_for": ["Higher highs and higher lows from 2358.62 to 2850, and the window's most forceful bars are bull: 2507.15 -> 2578.6 (1789732800000), 2579.97 -> 2636.28 (1789747200000), 2658.81 -> 2723.15 with a 2850 high (1789977600000).", "The advance contained only one pullback (to 2569.8 at 1789862400000) before resuming to new highs, the shape of a bull channel rather than a top.", "The last higher low 2569.8 is intact; the current pullback low 2641.37 is 71.37 above it, so the swing structure still has a higher low.", "The final bar is a bull reversal bar closing near its high (2676.47 vs high 2681.21, about 88% of its range) after the bear break, so no acceptance lower yet.", "The failure of the 2358.62 downside break (bear trap) preceded the whole advance, showing buyers active below the prior range."], "missing_information": [], "observations": ["Roughly the first 70 bars (1788465600000-1789473599999) are a broad two-sided range; the bulk traded 2411.04 (low, bar 1789041600000) to 2545.29 (high, bar 1789156800000), with one-off spikes to 2680 (bar 1789128000000) and 2609.02 (bar 1789416000000).", "The 1789128000000 bar spiked 2457.12 -> 2680 and closed 2555.52, but the next bar reversed (high 2607.62, close 2538.73) and price slid back into the range: a failed bull spike.", "Bars 1789473600000 (close 2423.29) and 1789488000000 (close 2412.95) took out the range low to 2358.62, then reversed; that failed downside break is the origin of the subsequent advance.", "From 2358.62 price advanced to 2850 (bar 1789977600000, range 191.94, close 2723.15) with strong bull bars 2507.15 -> 2578.6 (1789732800000) and 2579.97 -> 2636.28 (1789747200000), a single pullback to 2569.8 (1789862400000), then a resumption: higher highs and higher lows.", "Since the 2850 spike the last 13 completed bars overlap between 2716.01 (low, bar 1790049600000) and 2804.59 (high, bar 1790020800000); 2850 was never retested and 2804.59 is a lower high.", "Bars 1789977600000 (high 2850, close 2723.15) and 1789992000000 (high 2795, close 2754.31) left large upper tails, and highs since step down: 2804.59, 2778.33 (1790121600000), 2727.77 (1790164800000), 2681.21 (1790179200000).", "Bar 1790164800000 broke the 13-bar range low (open 2726.71, low 2648.49, close 2659). Bar 1790179200000 made a lower low 2641.37 but closed bull at 2676.47, near its high 2681.21 (88% of its 39.84 range).", "The two-bar drop fully retraced the 1789977600000 spike bar (that spike opened 2658.81, the pullback low is 2641.37), while still holding above the last higher low 2569.8."], "phase": "range", "primary_regime": "bull-trend", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Broad two-sided range covering roughly the first 70 bars; the bulk traded 2411.04-2545.29 with isolated spikes to 2680 and 2609.02, then the low was probed to 2358.62 before reversing.", "end_time_ms": 1789473599999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2411.04", "start_time_ms": 1788465600000, "upper_boundary": "2545.29"}, {"description": "Bull trend leg from the 2358.62 low to the 2850 high: higher highs and higher lows, one pullback to 2569.8 (bar 1789862400000), then a resumption ending in the spike bar 1789977600000.", "end_time_ms": 1789991999999, "kind": "swing", "lower_boundary": "2358.62", "start_time_ms": 1789488000000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}, {"description": "Thirteen-bar top range after the spike: heavily overlapping bars between 2716.01 (bar 1790049600000) and 2804.59 (bar 1790020800000); the 2850 high is not retested.", "end_time_ms": 1790164799999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2716.01", "start_time_ms": 1789992000000, "upper_boundary": "2804.59"}, {"description": "Downside breakout attempt from the top range: bar 1790164800000 opened 2726.71 and broke to 2648.49 (close 2659), bar 1790179200000 printed 2641.37; no acceptance yet since the second bar closed bull at 2676.47.", "end_time_ms": 1790193599999, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "2641.37", "start_time_ms": 1790164800000, "upper_boundary": "2716.01"}, {"description": "Possible major-trend-reversal shape: bull high 2850, lower high 2804.59, then a two-bar bear leg breaking the top-range low; unconfirmed because the last higher low 2569.8 holds and the break has no bear follow-through close.", "end_time_ms": 1790193599999, "kind": "mtr-like", "lower_boundary": "2569.8", "start_time_ms": 1789977600000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "H4", "transition_conditions": ["Bear resolution: an H4 close below 2641.37, followed by a lower high and a break of 2569.8 with bear follow-through, would confirm the mtr-like structure and shift the read toward trading-range or bear-trend.", "Bull restoration: a bull close back above 2716.01 and then 2727.77, a higher low above 2641.37, and a test of 2778.33/2804.59 would re-establish the bull channel read.", "Continued overlap between 2641.37 and 2804.59 without a new swing extreme keeps the phase classified as a range at the top of the bull leg.", "Repeated bull closes back above 2804.59 that retest 2850 would restore the always-in long relevance from low toward higher."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "current"}}, "raw": {"H1": [{"close": "2612.02", "close_time_ms": 1789775999999, "high": "2620.97", "low": "2608.83", "open": "2620.29", "open_